        "title_size": 2,
        "title": "<p>Office Phone Booths</p>",
        "subtitle": "",
        "subheading_richtext": "<p>Innovative <strong>office phone booths</strong> for today’s bustling work environments, providing a haven of focus and productivity. Our carefully designed <strong>office phone booths</strong> create a cocoon of tranquillity for private conversations, focused work, and creative brainstorming.</p>"
      }
    },
    "04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Discover Our Office Phone Booths – Privacy and Productivity Perfected"
          }
        },
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Welcome to Soundbox’s <strong>Office Phone Booths collection</strong>—your trusted source for premium acoustic booths that bring focus, privacy, and professionalism into today’s workplaces. Whether you’re upgrading a corporate office, equipping a coworking hub, or supporting hybrid teams, our <strong>office phone booths</strong> provide enclosed, distraction-free environments built for modern work.</p><h2>Why Choose Our Office Phone Booths?</h2><h3>Enhanced Productivity & Focus</h3><p>Our <strong>office phone booths</strong> give employees the freedom to take calls, join video meetings, or concentrate on focused work—without interruptions.</p><h3>Superior Acoustic Privacy</h3><p>Designed with advanced sound-absorbing materials, acoustic seals, and airtight structures, each booth ensures private conversations remain confidential while external noise stays outside.</p><h3>Quick Installation & Flexibility</h3><p>Forget long refurbishments—our modular phone booths are engineered for fast assembly and easy relocation, making them ideal for agile workplaces.</p><h3>Built for Comfort</h3><p>Integrated ventilation, ergonomic seating options, and soft LED lighting create a calm, comfortable space that supports wellbeing and productivity throughout the day.</p><h3>Adaptable Solutions for Every Need</h3><p>From compact single-user booths to two-person models for private discussions, our range covers the essentials of modern office communication and focus.</p><h2>What Makes Our Office Phone Booths Stand Out</h2><ul><li><br/><strong>Mobility & Modularity</strong> – Lightweight construction and optional wheels allow for effortless repositioning.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Tech-Ready Interiors</strong> – Power outlets, USB ports, and connectivity built in to support digital workflows.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Proven Acoustic Engineering</strong> – Independently tested to recognised standards such as ISO 23351-1 for reliable noise reduction.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Ergonomic & Stylish Design</strong> – Blending comfort with sleek finishes to complement contemporary office aesthetics.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Eco-Friendly Materials</strong> – Sustainable panels, energy-efficient lighting, and recyclable components help reduce environmental impact.<br/></li></ul><h2>Tips to Maximise Your Office Phone Booth Investment</h2><ul><li><br/><strong>Position Strategically</strong> – Place booths close to collaborative zones but away from heavy foot traffic.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Define Purpose Zones</strong> – Allocate booths for calls or deep work to encourage clear and consistent usage.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Involve Staff</strong> – Gather employee feedback to optimise booth placement and improve uptake.<br/></li></ul><h2>The Office Phone Booth Advantage</h2><p>Research shows open-plan offices can cut productivity by as much as 70% due to noise and constant interruption. Incorporating <strong>office phone booths</strong> as quiet sanctuaries restores focus, improves wellbeing, and helps staff perform at their best.</p><h2>Explore Our Office Phone Booth Categories</h2><ul><li><br/><strong>Solo Phone Booths</strong> – Ideal for confidential calls, video meetings, or uninterrupted deep work.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Two-Person Phone Booths</strong> – Compact spaces designed for private conversations, one-to-ones, or collaborative focus.<br/></li></ul><p>Customisable finishes, acoustic ratings, and ergonomic options available—browse the collection to find the right fit for your workplace.</p><h2>Explore Our Acoustic Booth & Office Pod Collection</h2><p>Ready to elevate your office with private, stylish, and effective <strong>office phone booths</strong>? Explore the collection today, compare models, and contact our workspace specialists for expert advice or bulk purchase support.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
